<title>DUSTLINE — Kestrel Yard: a three.js tactical FPS</title>
<style>
  /* Look plan: canvas, surface, hairline, ink, muted and one accent — the same names
     as PALETTE in src/palette.js — plus team colours and one danger red. */
  :root {
    --canvas: #191d24;
    --surface: #2a2f38;
    --hairline: #3a4150;
    --ink: #e8e4d8;
    --muted: #8b95a5;
    --accent: #f0a830;
    --danger: #e5484d;
    --ally: #3fb97f;
